# Commit Message Template

# Subject (50 characters or less)
# ------------------------
# Write a short, imperative summary of the change
# Example: "Fix bug in user authentication"

# Body (72 characters per line)
# ----------------------------
# Explain what was changed and why.
# 
# - What problem does this solve?
# - What is the impact?
# - Any side effects?

# Footer
# ------
# Reference any issues or tickets
# Example: "Closes #123"
# Example: "Fixes JIRA-456"
